    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Traditionally bred for guarding herds from the terrors of the frozen steppe in Kislev, the white-coated Oblast Spirit Dog is a robust animal. Famous for its dogged stamina and independent nature, Spirit Dogs are known for being imperturbable, no matter the circumstances. They have heavy heads and low-set necks with a dewlap, held up by a solid, well-proportioned body. Not a friendly dog, it is nevertheless reputed as one of the most loyal breeds, and is a popular, albeit rare, addition to fighting pits across the east of the Empire.</p>"
